flowchart TB
  UI[Linen browser] --> AUTH[Loopback / same origin / local session]
  AUTH --> API[FastAPI]
  API --> TASK[Bounded static task queue]
  TASK --> CHILD[Owned scanner process tree]
  CHILD --> ENGINE[SHA256 / TLSH-SSDeep / YARA-X / ClamAV / ML]
  ENGINE --> OR[Frozen evidence-or-v1]
  OR --> DB[(Private task SQLite)]
  API --> LOG[Bounded Sysmon parser]
  LOG --> SIGMA[Versioned Sigma subset and process graph]
  SIGMA --> BDB[(Private behavior SQLite)]
  DB --> LINK[Exact log-claimed SHA256 link]
  BDB --> LINK
  LINK --> UI
